### ===== User/Guest API (활성 상품만 조회) =====

### 상품 목록 조회 (기본)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products?page=0&size=20

### 상품 목록 조회 (브랜드 필터)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products?brandId=1&page=0&size=20

### 상품 목록 조회 (정렬: 가격 낮은순)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products?sortType=PRICE_ASC&page=0&size=20

### 상품 목록 조회 (정렬: 가격 높은순)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products?sortType=PRICE_DESC&page=0&size=20

### 상품 상세 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/products/1


### ===== Admin API (LDAP 인증 필요) =====

### [Admin] 상품 생성
POST http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-Ldap: admin

{
  "brandId": 1,
  "name": "에어맥스 90",
  "price": 169000,
  "stock": 100,
  "description": "나이키 에어맥스 90 클래식"
}

### [Admin] 상품 생성 - 설명 없이
POST http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-Ldap: admin

{
  "brandId": 1,
  "name": "에어포스 1",
  "price": 139000,
  "stock": 50
}

### [Admin] 상품 생성 실패 - 이름 누락 (400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-Ldap: admin

{
  "brandId": 1,
  "price": 100000,
  "stock": 10
}

### [Admin] 상품 생성 실패 - LDAP 헤더 없음 (401)
POST http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "brandId": 1,
  "name": "테스트 상품",
  "price": 10000,
  "stock": 10
}


### ===== Admin 조회 API =====

### [Admin] 상품 목록 조회 (전체 - 삭제 포함)
GET http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/products?page=0&size=20
X-Loopers-Ldap: admin

### [Admin] 상품 목록 조회 (브랜드 필터)
GET http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/products?brandId=1&page=0&size=20
X-Loopers-Ldap: admin

### [Admin] 상품 상세 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/products/1
X-Loopers-Ldap: admin


### ===== Admin 수정 API =====

### [Admin] 상품 수정
PUT http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-Ldap: admin

{
  "name": "에어맥스 90 리뉴얼",
  "price": 179000,
  "stock": 200,
  "description": "리뉴얼된 에어맥스 90"
}

### [Admin] 상품 수정 실패 - 이름 누락 (400)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/products/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-Loopers-Ldap: admin

{
  "price": 100000,
  "stock": 10
}


### ===== Admin 삭제 API =====

### [Admin] 상품 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/products/1
X-Loopers-Ldap: admin

### [Admin] 상품 삭제 실패 - 존재하지 않는 상품 (404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api-admin/v1/products/99999
X-Loopers-Ldap: admin
